{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","炸裂吧！战车！"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","炸裂！戦車！"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","打造一辆玩具车或者控制玩具车致盲敌人。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","おもちゃの戦車を作る、もしくはおもちゃの戦車を操作して敵に暗闇を付与"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，达米安在战斗中不会被攻击，战斗开始时会在布阵位置打造一辆玩具车，继承自身85% + 10%的生命值和100%的其他属性，随后自身退至场外，并会在场上其他友军全部被击败后撤离战场。使用终极技能时，若场上已有玩具车，则驱使玩具车冲向目标位置爆炸，玩具车爆炸时每剩余10%生命值会使达米安恢复80点能量，并对1格范围的敌人造成320% ATK伤害并施加致盲，持续3秒；若场上没有玩具车，则会打造一辆新的玩具车并移动至目标位置。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：戦闘中、自身は攻撃されない。戦闘開始時、配置位置におもちゃの戦車を作り、自身のHPの85% + 10%と他のステータスの100%を引き継ぐ。その後、自身はフィールド外に退避。他の味方が全員撃破されると撤退する。アクティブ効果：必殺技発動時、フィールドに既におもちゃの戦車が存在する場合、戦車を指定位置に移動させ、爆発させる。爆発時、戦車のHPに応じて、10%につき、自身のSPが80回復。さらに1マス内の敵に320% ATKのダメージを与え、3秒間の暗闇を付与。フィールドにおもちゃの戦車が存在しない場合、新しく作り、指定位置に移動させる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":164,"end":172,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":177,"end":179,"tooltip_key":"keyword:blind"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":211,"end":219,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":232,"end":234,"tooltip_key":"keyword:blind"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至330% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが330% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至340% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが340% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至350% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが350% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至360% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが360% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","紧急救援！"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","緊急救援！"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","控制玩具车回复友军生命值或自身回复能量。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","おもちゃの戦車を操作し、味方のHPまたは自身のSPを回復"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","若场上已有玩具车，则控制玩具车为3格范围内最虚弱的一名友军奏乐，使其回复4次-120% − 10% ATK生命值。若场上没有玩具车，则使达米安回复300点能量。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","フィールドにおもちゃの戦車が存在する場合、それを操作して音楽を流す。周囲3マス以内の最も弱っている味方1体のHPを4回回復。1回につき、-120% − 10% ATK分のHPを回復。おもちゃの戦車が存在しない場合、自身のSPを300回復"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":73,"end":79,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":38,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":42,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":68,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","回复的生命值提升至-130% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","HP回復量が-130% − 10% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/va