ption_i18n/jp","おもちゃの飛行機を操作して、最も遠い敵に花火爆弾を投下し、250% + 20% ATKのダメージを与え、3秒間のスタンを付与"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":33,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":29,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","眩晕时间提升至5秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","スタンの持続時間が5秒にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至275% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが275% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが300% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の攻撃力UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+12%"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+16%"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+20%"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","发明家意志"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","発明家の心意気"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","玩具车提升周围友方英雄急速。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","おもちゃの戦車で周囲の味方英雄の速度UP"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每一辆玩具车在首次响应“紧急救援！”时会展开音乐光环，对周围2格的非召唤物友军进行鼓舞，提升其40点急速，持续10秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","各おもちゃの戦車が初めて「緊急救援！」に応える時、音楽の光の輪を10秒間展開し、周囲2マス範囲内の召喚ユニット以外の味方の速度+40"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","期间还会每秒使周围2格的友军回复-80% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","光の輪を展開している間、周囲2マス以内の味方のHPを-80% ATK分回復"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":26,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","对非召唤物友军进行鼓舞提升其50点急速。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","鼓舞した対象の速度上昇量が50にUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对非召唤物友军进行鼓舞提升其55点急速。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","鼓舞した対象の速度上昇量が55にUP"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“炸裂吧！战车！”在玩具车剩余生命值较高时，致盲持续时间提升。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","おもちゃの戦車のHP割合が多い場合、スキル「炸裂！戦車！」による暗闇の持続時間UP"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“炸裂吧！战车！”在玩具车剩余生命值百分比高于50%时，造成的致盲的持续时间提升至7秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","おもちゃの戦車のHP割合が50%より高い場合、スキル「炸裂！戦車！」による暗闇の持続時間が7秒にUP"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"keyword:blind"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":37,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"keyword:blind"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","释放“紧急救援”时，若场上有玩具车，玩具车治疗友军距离提高到全场，且额外选择一名友军进行治疗；场上无玩具车时，自身额外选择一名最虚弱的友军，使其回复300% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「緊急救援」を発動する時、フィールド上におもちゃの戦車が存在する場合、おもちゃの戦車の回復範囲がフィールド全体になり、追加で味方1体を回復。フィールド上におもちゃの戦車が存在しない場合、SPを回復した後に最も弱っている味方1体のHPを300% ATK回復"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":74,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":117,"end":125,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","花朵指挥棒"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","鼓舞の花"]]}